<p>Still hesitant between a +1 or no vote&#8230; OK, +1 because I do like graffitis&#8230;</p>
<p>I agree the video is cool, but does not look real. 50 square cm per second seems pretty fast to me and it would not need to be stop motion.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>What exactly are 'infrared limited goggle' and why have them?</p>
