<p>The way I understand, with infrared you see things according to their temperature and since the graffiti probably has the same temperature as the surface, then you won't distinguish it.</p>
<p>However I'm not sure about the dry-ice blasting. This can clean graffitis, but why is is necessary for the guards to have them equipped at all time? The way I understand, you stop it by stopping the observer, then you can take your time to clean it.</p>

